Package: librobotweax-srt0.2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Robotweax Secure Reliable Transport shared library
 Independent SRT implementation with a namespaced library and SONAME 0.2.
 It does not replace the Haivision SRT shared library.

Package: librobotweax-srt-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: librobotweax-srt0.2 (= ${binary:Version}), libssl-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for Robotweax Secure Reliable Transport
 Headers, CMake target and pkg-config file for the Robotweax SRT library.
 Select this provider explicitly when building an application.
